{"vid":"tdT3o4WXy3k","source":"tdT3o4WXy3k.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.8,"txt":"my name is Shane savage and I'm with the"},{"t":5.6,"txt":"Ford UAW veterans welding program my"},{"t":8.8,"txt":"military background was close to 15"},{"t":11.3,"txt":"years dual service I was 4 years marine"},{"t":13.7,"txt":"corps got out and then came back in in"},{"t":15.7,"txt":"2005 into the army and then was"},{"t":18.5,"txt":"medically retired in May of 2015 from"},{"t":20.7,"txt":"injuries sustained in combat"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"I was recently retired in May of 2015"},{"t":29.1,"txt":"from the military and was contacted by a"},{"t":32.6,"txt":"warrior family support foundation to do"},{"t":35.2,"txt":"a joint welding program between Ford and"},{"t":38.8,"txt":"war your family support foundation to"},{"t":41.7,"txt":"get veterans out and learning a new"},{"t":42.9,"txt":"career path the accomplishments and the"},{"t":45.1,"txt":"things that you can do with your hands"},{"t":46.4,"txt":"or what attracted me to the program you"},{"t":48.5,"txt":"can start out with a plain piece of"},{"t":50.1,"txt":"steel you can do some modifications to"},{"t":51.6,"txt":"it you can have a beautiful piece of"},{"t":52.8,"txt":"piece of art or you can go out in the"},{"t":56.4,"txt":"back 40 and go fix the tractor or"},{"t":58.6,"txt":"there's just the possibilities are"},{"t":61,"txt":"endless when I finished up this program"},{"t":63.1,"txt":"I hope to attain a 3G welding"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"certification which is going to allow me"},{"t":68.9,"txt":"to apply myself in to more job"},{"t":71.9,"txt":"opportunities and also better pay you"},{"t":74.4,"txt":"can stack these these certifications up"},{"t":76.3,"txt":"on top of each other and go apply for a"},{"t":78.5,"txt":"job for instance as a heavy equipment"},{"t":80.8,"txt":"operator that's also a certified welder"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"and your pay will almost will almost"},{"t":85.2,"txt":"double make a lot of money in the"},{"t":87.